<title>NETHERLANDS: Kempen ups Pakhoed to outperformer.</title>
<headline>Kempen ups Pakhoed to outperformer.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Sept 20 research.</p>
<p>Company------------Sector-----------Price-----Broker--------</p>
<p>    Pakhoed	Storage/Distribution   49.30     Kempen</p>
<p>COMMENT: &quot;Pakhoed is a significant potential turnaround story.&quot; The leverage in earnings is expected from a turnaround of recently acquired Univar and reorganisation of European oil storage.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS    P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)	4.07   11.5    1.80</p>
